    {
      "sentenceId": "hcp2_1",
      "text": "我去看蓝色的帽子。",
      "startMs": 0,
      "endMs": 2560,
      "durationMs": 2560,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/histoire_chapeau_p2_hcp2_1.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "hcp2_2",
      "text": "蓝色的帽子很好看，也不贵。",
      "startMs": 2560,
      "endMs": 5480,
      "durationMs": 2920,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/histoire_chapeau_p2_hcp2_2.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "hcp2_3",
      "text": "我试了试，很合适。",
      "startMs": 5480,
      "endMs": 7840,
      "durationMs": 2360,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/histoire_chapeau_p2_hcp2_3.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "hcp2_4",
      "text": "我问服务员：“这个帽子多少钱？”",
      "startMs": 7840,
      "endMs": 12080,
      "durationMs": 4240,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/histoire_chapeau_p2_hcp2_4.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "hcp2_5",
      "text": "服务员说：“五十块。”",
      "startMs": 12080,
      "endMs": 14800,
      "durationMs": 2720,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/histoire_chapeau_p2_hcp2_5.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "hcp2_6",
      "text": "我觉得可以，就买了。",
      "startMs": 14800,
      "endMs": 17600,
      "durationMs": 2800,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/histoire_chapeau_p2_hcp2_6.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "hcp2_7",
      "text": "我的朋友说：“这个帽子真好看。”",
      "startMs": 17600,
      "endMs": 21520,
      "durationMs": 3920,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/histoire_chapeau_p2_hcp2_7.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "hcp2_8",
      "text": "我很高兴。",
      "startMs": 21520,
      "endMs": 22960,
      "durationMs": 1440,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/histoire_chapeau_p2_hcp2_8.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "hcp2_9",
      "text": "虽然红色帽子也很好看，但是蓝色的更便宜。",
      "startMs": 22960,
      "endMs": 28720,
      "durationMs": 5760,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/histoire_chapeau_p2_hcp2_9.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "hcp2_10",
      "text": "所以，我买了蓝色的帽子。",
